flowchart TD
    User[User] --> UI[React/Vite demo UI]
    UI --> API[FastAPI API]
    API --> Service[Demo investigation service]

    Service --> Registry[(SQLite run registry)]
    Service --> Retrieval[Deterministic evidence retrieval]
    Retrieval --> Telemetry[(Synthetic logs, traces, metrics)]

    Service --> Graph[LangGraph workflow]
    Graph --> Checkpoints[(SQLite checkpoints)]

    Graph --> Generation[Hypothesis generation node]
    Generation --> GeneratorAdapter[Azure OpenAI generator adapter]
    GeneratorAdapter --> GeneratorModel[Azure OpenAI deployment]

    Graph --> Validation[Evidence validation node]
    Validation --> Review[Hypothesis review policy]

    Graph --> Critic[Semantic critic node]
    Critic --> CriticAdapter[Azure OpenAI critic adapter]
    CriticAdapter --> CriticModel[Azure OpenAI deployment]

    Review --> HumanPolicy[Human review assessment]
    HumanPolicy --> Gate{Review required?}
    Gate -->|No| Report[Final cited report]
    Gate -->|Yes| Interrupt[LangGraph interrupt]
    Interrupt --> Resume[Approve or reject]
    Resume --> Report

    Report --> API
    API --> UI

    Eval[Evaluation CLI] --> Service
    Eval --> EvalReviewer[Unsupported-claim reviewer]
    EvalReviewer --> EvalModel[Azure OpenAI evaluation deployment]

    Observability[Structured logs and optional spans]
    Retrieval --> Observability
    Graph --> Observability
    Generation --> Observability
    Critic --> Observability
    Eval --> Observability
